<!doctype html><html lang="hi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Online Admission · C-Net Library</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f7fa;color:#172d40;font:16px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:16px}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;margin-bottom:20px}header img{width:220px;max-width:55vw}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dce5eb;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:18px}h1{margin:0;font-size:27px}h2{font-size:20px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}label{font-weight:bold;display:block}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #b8c8d4;border-radius:8px;font:inherit;margin-top:5px}button,.btn{display:inline-block;background:#0f766e;color:white;padding:12px 18px;border:0;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.note{background:#eef8f6;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.error{background:#fff0ec;padding:12px;color:#9b2c14}.seats{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}.seats label{cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #c2d9d4;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}.seats label:has(input:checked){background:#dcfce7;border-color:#0f766e}.seats input{width:auto;margin:0 5px 0 0}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}td,th{padding:8px;border:1px solid #d9e2ea;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}small{color:#52697a}.scroll{overflow:auto}@media(max-width:640px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:10px}.card{padding:16px}header{flex-wrap:wrap}}@media print{.no-print{display:none!important}body{background:white}.wrap{max-width:none;padding:0}.card{border:0;padding:5px;break-inside:avoid}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}table{font-size:10px}@page{size:A4 landscape;margin:12mm}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><header><a href="{{ route('home') }}"><img src="{{ asset('images/cnet-library-logo.png') }}" alt="C-Net Library"></a><a href="{{ route('home') }}">होमपेज</a></header><div class="card"><h1>Admission Application</h1><p>कैंपस और पढ़ने की अवधि चुनें → उपलब्ध समय देखें → अपनी सीट चुनें → फीस देखकर आवेदन करें। अंतिम आवंटन एडमिन अप्रूवल पर होगा।</p>
